---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);

const firstRunHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/first-run/');
const archiveHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/archive/');
const redesignHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/');
const archiveLinks = [
  { href: p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage1-previous/'), label: t('历史 Stage 1', 'Historical Stage 1') },
  { href: p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-256-window/'), label: t('旧 Stage 2：256-window 设计', 'Old Stage 2: 256-window design') },
  { href: p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-ceiling/'), label: 'Ceiling-1.0' },
  { href: p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/harness-2-0/'), label: t('Harness 诊断记录', 'Harness diagnostic record') },
];
---
<section class="map-lobby" data-testid="openevo-capability-map-lobby" aria-labelledby="map-lobby-title">
  <header class="map-lobby__head">
    <p>OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · CAPABILITY EXPLORATION</p>
    <h1 id="map-lobby-title">{t('OpenEvo 能力探索', 'OpenEvo capability exploration')}</h1>
    <div class="map-lobby__intro">
      <strong>{t(
        '我们先跑了一轮完整的 Stage 1 → Stage 2。7B 证明这套方法能够持续产生参数更新，3B 和长期运行则暴露了更新规则、行动接口和参数容量的问题。',
        'We first ran a full Stage 1 → Stage 2 exploration. The 7B run showed that the method could sustain parameter updates, while the 3B run and long-horizon execution exposed problems in the update rule, action interface, and parameter capacity.'
      )}</strong>
      <span>{t(
        '后来的 OpenEvo 重设计直接来自这些实验，但新的行动接口会改变模型真正走出的轨迹，所以新版不能假装是旧实验的普通下一步。我们把历史探索和新版实验拆成两张地图。',
        'The later OpenEvo redesign came directly from those experiments, but the new action interface changes the trajectories the model actually produces. The redesign therefore cannot be presented as an ordinary next step in the old lineage, so the two stories live on separate maps.'
      )}</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="map-lobby__choices" aria-label={t('选择实验地图', 'Choose an experiment map')}>
    <a class="map-choice map-choice--historical" href={firstRunHref} data-map-choice="first-run">
      <span class="map-choice__state">{t('历史地图', 'HISTORICAL MAP')}</span>
      <h2>{t('第一轮 OpenEvo 实验', 'First OpenEvo experiment run')}</h2>
      <p>{t(
        '从旧 Stage 1 走到 Stage 2，优先看 7B 怎样持续更新、参数容量为什么中途需要 amendment，以及 3B 怎样把研究推向新的 Harness。',
        'Follow the old Stage 1 into Stage 2, with the 7B sustained-evolution path first, the capacity amendment in context, and the 3B evidence that pushed the project toward a new harness.'
      )}</p>
      <strong>{t('进入第一轮实验 →', 'Open the first-run map →')}</strong>
    </a>

    <a class="map-choice map-choice--current" href={redesignHref} data-map-choice="redesign">
      <span class="map-choice__state">{t('当前设计路线', 'CURRENT DESIGN ROUTE')}</span>
      <h2>{t('重新设计 OpenEvo', 'Redesigning OpenEvo')}</h2>
      <p>{t(
        '从新的行动接口重新采集 Stage 1，再做 MiniMax 任务后分析、Stage 1 downstream 准备和新的 Stage 2。旧轨迹保留为历史证据，不冒充新版数据。',
        'Start again from a new action interface and fresh Stage 1, then rebuild the MiniMax post-hoc analysis, Stage-1 downstream preparation, and the new Stage 2. Old trajectories remain historical evidence rather than being relabeled as redesign data.'
      )}</p>
      <strong>{t('进入新版实验 →', 'Open the redesign map →')}</strong>
    </a>
  </nav>

  <details class="map-lobby__archive">
    <summary>{t('实验档案：旧 Stage 1、旧 Stage 2、Ceiling-1.0 与 Harness 诊断', 'Experiment archive: old Stage 1, old Stage 2, Ceiling-1.0, and harness diagnostics')}</summary>
    <p>{t(
      '这些页面保留精确的历史实验、数字和技术证据，但不再和两张主地图争夺第一层导航。Server/Kaggle、429/retry、G3 attempt、checkpoint / HF、runtime patch 与 PR / SHA 也集中放进完整档案。',
      'These pages preserve exact historical experiments, metrics, and technical evidence without competing with the two primary maps for top-level navigation. Server/Kaggle, 429/retry, G3 attempts, checkpoint / HF, runtime patches, and PR / SHA evidence are grouped in the full archive.'
    )}</p>
    <a class="map-lobby__archive-main" href={archiveHref}>{t('打开完整实验档案 →', 'Open the full experiment archive →')}</a>
    <nav aria-label={t('实验档案链接', 'Experiment archive links')}>
      {archiveLinks.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
    </nav>
  </details>
</section>

<style>
.map-lobby{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto 4rem}
.map-lobby__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:1.6rem;align-items:end;padding:1.5rem 0 1.35rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.map-lobby__head>p{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0;color:var(--accent-deep);font:800 .68rem/1.3 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.09em}
.map-lobby__head h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,5.6vw,5rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.055em}
.map-lobby__intro{display:grid;gap:.5rem;max-width:42rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
.map-lobby__intro strong{color:var(--ink);font-size:1.02rem}
.map-lobby__intro span{font-size:.92rem}
.map-lobby__choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;padding:1.4rem 0}
.map-choice{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:.72rem;min-height:16.5rem;padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-feature);background:var(--surface);color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .16s ease,background-color .16s ease}
.map-choice:hover,.map-choice:focus-visible{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--surface-muted)}
.map-choice:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
.map-choice__state{width:max-content;font:800 .66rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)}
.map-choice--current .map-choice__state{color:var(--accent-deep)}
.map-choice h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2.1rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em}
.map-choice p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
.map-choice>strong{align-self:end;margin-top:auto;color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:.9rem}
.map-lobby__archive{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:1rem 0;color:var(--muted)}
.map-lobby__archive summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);font-weight:750;line-height:1.45}
.map-lobby__archive p{max-width:48rem;margin:.75rem 0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6}
.map-lobby__archive-main{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:.7rem;color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:.88rem;font-weight:760;text-underline-offset:.2em}
.map-lobby__archive nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem 1rem}
.map-lobby__archive a{color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:.88rem;text-underline-offset:.2em}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .map-lobby{width:min(100% - 1rem,1120px)}
  .map-lobby__head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.65rem;padding:1rem 0}
  .map-lobby__head>p{grid-column:auto}
  .map-lobby__head h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,12vw,3.6rem)}
  .map-lobby__intro{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5}
  .map-lobby__choices{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:1rem 0}
  .map-choice{min-height:0;padding:1rem}
  .map-lobby__archive nav{display:grid;gap:.55rem}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.map-choice{transition:none}}
</style>
